40763144,15,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"The drugs received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing included TDF, 3TC, DTG, AZT, LPV/r, ATV, and others.",Majority of participants 65 4 underwent HIVDR testing in 2023 following revised national criteria to test all PLHIV failing on ART regardless of treatment line Table 1b Protection of overrides trtds All PLHIV regardless of age who had been on ART for at least one year had a non suppressed HIV viral load gt 1000 copies ml and underwent an HIVDR test between 1st January 2021 30th December 2023 Treatment line All included participants had been on ART for at least one year 295 All PLHIV on ART in Uganda receive a VL test annually Those with a non suppressed VL undergo intensive adherence counselling IAC for three months with a repeat VL at the end Individuals with a persistent non suppressed VL are eligible for an HIVDR test A Plasma or dried blood spot DBS sample is collected and referred to the HIVDR testing facility at a central national laboratory Here RNA extraction is done using commercial kits followed by reverse transcription and Polymerase Chain Reaction PCR amplification OTHERS TDF 3TC AZT 3TC DTG TDF 3TC DTG ABC 3TC DTG ABC 3TC LPVr TDF 3TC ATVr AZT 3TC ATVr OTHERS,"The paper lists the specific drugs that were part of the ART regimens at the time of sample collection, which were received before sample sequencing."
