41091504,12,How many individuals had samples obtained for HIV sequencing?,"The paper does not report any individuals or samples, as it does not include sequenced samples.","The study we are using a very potent inhibitor, darunavir, bound to a series of 28 variants of HIV-1 protease with affinities from picomolar to micromolar, to develop an accurate method for predicting resistance.",The paper ffocuses on computational modeling and does not report any individuals from whom samples were obtained.
41091504,13,Does the paper report HIV sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs?,"The paper does not report any sequences or previous ARV drug use, as it focuses on protease variants and their dynamics.","The study we are using a very potent inhibitor, darunavir, bound to a series of 28 variants of HIV-1 protease with affinities from picomolar to micromolar, to develop an accurate method for predicting resistance.",The paper does not mention any sequences from individuals with a treatment history.
41091504,14,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"The paper does not report any drug classes received by individuals, it does not include sequenced samples.","The large number of drug-resistant sequences from patient samples and viral evolution experiments have resulted in a plethora of experimental data from us and others,",The paper does not provide any information on drug classes received before sample sequencing.
