41130593,11,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,Yes,"The PURPOSE trials assessed the efficacy of LEN and emtricitabine/tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (F/TDF) in cisgender women (PURPOSE 1; P1) and in cisgender men, transgender women, transgender men and gender nonbinary persons (PURPOSE 2; P2).","The paper describes the PURPOSE trials, indicating that the patients were part of clinical trials."
